      "source": "A <a href=\"ServletContextInitializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>ServletContextInitializer</code></a> to register <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/EventListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>EventListener</code></a>s in a Servlet\n3.0+ container. Similar to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContext.html#addListener(T)\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>registration</code></a> features provided by <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContext</code></a> but with a Spring Bean\nfriendly design.\n\nThis bean can be used to register the following types of listener:\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContextAttributeListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContextAttributeListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletRequestListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletRequestListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletRequestAttributeListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletRequestAttributeListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/http/HttpSessionAttributeListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.http\"><code>HttpSessionAttributeListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/http/HttpSessionIdListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.http\"><code>HttpSessionIdListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/http/HttpSessionListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.http\"><code>HttpSessionListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContextListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContextListener</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "一个 <a href=\"ServletContextInitializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>ServletContextInitializer</code></a> 用于在 Servlet 3.0+ 容器中注册 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/EventListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>EventListener</code></a>s。类似于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContext.html#addListener(T)\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>registration</code></a> 功能，由 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContext</code></a> 提供，但采用了 Spring Bean 友好的设计。\n\n此 Bean 可用于注册以下类型的监听器：\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContextAttributeListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContextAttributeListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletRequestListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletRequestListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletRequestAttributeListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletRequestAttributeListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/http/HttpSessionAttributeListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.http\"><code>HttpSessionAttributeListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/http/HttpSessionIdListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.http\"><code>HttpSessionIdListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/http/HttpSessionListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.http\"><code>HttpSessionListener</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContextListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContextListener</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
